	<div class="p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 column - 1 row my-3:30:61">
<div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 column - 1 row my-3:30:61-1:1 column - 1 row:0">
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:29:22"></div>
<div class="row g-3 my-3 align-items-stretch" data-zesty-id="design:columns:3 Columns:7:2">
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:3 Columns:7:2-1:3 Columns:0">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:1:85"><h6>One-Time Opportunities</h6>

<p>
	Our one-time opportunities are perfect for those who want a quick and easy way to make a difference. These include activities like serving a meal any day of the year or ringing a bell during the holidays.
</p></div>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:3 Columns:7:2-1:3 Columns:1">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:3:0"><h6>Group Opportunities</h6>

<p>
	We can accommodate your group’s desire to do something good together – whether family, friends,coworkers, civic or church groups. Group volunteer activities are typically project-based or part of a larger event.
</p></div>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:3 Columns:7:2-1:3 Columns:2">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:5:86"><h6>Ongoing Opportunities</h6>

<p>
	Ongoing opportunities are designed for those who want to get involved on a regular basis. We’ll Know you by your first name, and you’ll get to know the people in our programs. These include activities like working with youth, using your professional skills or serving after a disaster strikes.
</p></div>
				</div>
			</div>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:9:58"></div>
<div class="row my-3" data-zesty-id="design:columns:4 Columns:16:19">
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:4 Columns:16:19-1:4 Columns:0">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:8:41"><h4><a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/tulsa-area-command/red-shield-youth-centers-of-tulsa" target=""><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Red Shield Youth Centers</span></a></h4>

<p>
	There are five Red Shield Youth Centers throughout Green Country offering a variety of volunteer opportunities to serve area youth. We are looking for individuals or groups to help with tutoring, coaching or teaching a special talent, such as music, photography or art.
</p></div>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:4 Columns:16:19-1:4 Columns:1">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:10:47"><h4><a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/tulsa-area-command/center-of-hope" target="">Center of Hope</a></h4>

<ul>
	<li>Special Events</li>
	<li>Seasonal Parties </li>
	<li>Seasonal Opportunities </li>
	<li>Food Service/Serving</li>
</ul></div>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:4 Columns:16:19-1:4 Columns:2">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:12:26"><h4><a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/tulsa-area-command/emergency-disaster-services" target=""><span><span>Emergency Disaster Services</span></span></a></h4>

<p>
	The Salvation Army Is often called upon to serve during times of disaster. Volunteers play a vital role in coming alongside us to care for those who have been displaced by fires, tornadoes and other natural disasters.
</p>

<ul>
	<li>Canteen Driver</li>
	<li>Food Service Specialist</li>
	<li>Cleaning Canteen</li>
	<li>Spiritual Care</li>
</ul></div>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-flex flex-column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:4 Columns:16:19-1:4 Columns:3">
<div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-area text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:14:22"><h4>Seasonal</h4>

<ul>
	<li>Volunteer at the Angel Tree booth</li>
	<li>Help with data entry during Angel Tree registration</li>
	<li>Sort and/or distribute Angel Tree gifts</li>
	<li>Bell Ringing, individuals and groups</li>
</ul></div>
